{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Defend your kingdom. Protect the sacred statues. Lead your knights to victory.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy is invading your lands, and only the <strong>Legendary Knight</strong>, the king himself, can rally his forces to stand against them. As both ruler and commander, you must <strong>lead your army</strong>, <strong>fortify defenses</strong>, and <strong>push back relentless waves of invaders</strong> to safeguard your kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the king and command your forces in strategic real-time battles. Every decision matters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the statues</strong> that represent your kingdom\u2019s ruling power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight alongside your knights</strong> to repel endless enemy waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage resources wisely</strong> to strengthen your army and upgrade your defenses</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Train &amp; Strategize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, carefully prepare for the enemy assault:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase powerful items</strong> to boost your combat strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train soldiers</strong> to improve their effectiveness in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign generals and units</strong> to defend key buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn new skills</strong> using experience gained on the battlefield to enhance your king and troops</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes &amp; Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your challenge and test your strategies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong> \u2192 Includes <strong>3 unique maps</strong> with up to <strong>40 intense waves</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2192 Survive as long as you can against an unstoppable horde</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Playable Heroes</strong> \u2192 Each with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+1 DLC Hero</strong> available for even greater variety</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty &amp; Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory won\u2019t come easy \u2014 one mistake could cost you everything:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the <strong>sacred statue</strong> is destroyed or the <strong>king falls</strong>, defeat is immediate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different heroes, upgrades, and strategies to adapt to tougher enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to survive longer, unlock new skills, and refine your tactics</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"65d3fb5b2f43a42f4a670270c2e7bb76392a737c.jpg","localized_name":"The Village","name":"The Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1240240/65d3fb5b2f43a42f4a670270c2e7bb76392a737c.jpg"},{"icon":"089d6d517dba2e685bf100e6d460987992d190d2.jpg","localized_name":"The Fortress","name":"The Fortress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1240240/089d6d517dba2e685bf100e6d460987992d190d2.jpg"},{"icon":"ae28ab73276645faaf7cd8b1bb675dd87d07de1e.jpg","localized_name":"Infantry","name":"Infantry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1240240/ae28ab73276645faaf7cd8b1bb675dd87d07de1e.jpg"},{"icon":"6b3914cdf6cb165ff89e9d969cc918b70c6eb76f.jpg","localized_name":"Guard","name":"Guard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1240240/6b3914cdf6cb165ff89e9d969cc918b70c6eb76f.jpg"},{"icon